    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51077" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĭrĭāthus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĭrĭātus</span></b> ,
